<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109680" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑρμίνη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχη, πόλις,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Theognost.
			<u>Can.</u>
			23
		</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑσμίνη,</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὑρμίνη,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			2.616
		</span></i>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕρον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῆνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕρους</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίμβλον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				23
			</span></i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑριατόμος</span> (q.v.).
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕρραδα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπυρίδιον,</span> ibid. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑρράδιος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγονίος ἢ ἄδοξος,</span> ibid., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὑρράδιος,</span>
			<i>son of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὕρρας,</span> i.e. Pittacus, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				634.31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔρραξ</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑράξ.</span>
			</div>
